# P19 forced job failure (developer hook; docs/bcm2722-reference/
# host-driver.md 8a): the next N jobs of a kind fail as if the chip refused
# them, to prove the loud CPU fallback and the return to the chip without
# a broken chip.  The device's rows (Developer > Advanced > Video chip >
# Fault injection) call the same hook as the script command below.
#  start-f0  the visualiser's frames go to the chip (BARS, 0x34);
#  f0-f1     the next visualiser jobs fail (two armed): the driver says
#            so ("bcmjob fault ... why=failed") and the view says CPU
#            FALLBACK once and draws on the CPU (a failed frame job takes
#            the view off the chip: the op is marked at two failures);
#  f1-f2     "bcm_jobfail viz 0" disarms and forgives the op (the rows'
#            "off"): the view is on the chip again (BARS submitted), with
#            no further fault.
# Runs on sim-ui-video:
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-video scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p19-jobfail.script
# logbetween: start f0 bcmjob submit op=0x34
# logbetween: start f0 no CPU FALLBACK
# logbetween: start f0 no bcmjob fault
# logbetween: f0 f1 bcmjob inject op=0x34 n=2
# logbetween: f0 f1 bcmjob fault op=0x34 why=failed
# logbetween: f0 f1 viz CPU FALLBACK why=
# logbetween: f1 f2 bcmjob inject op=0x34 n=0
# logbetween: f1 f2 bcmjob submit op=0x34
# logbetween: f1 f2 no bcmjob fault
# np: viz-full
# reset: viz
wait 3000
play_files /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Music
wait 700
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +10           # "Now Playing"
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Scrubber
wait 400
key SELECT          # Rating
wait 600
key SELECT          # Shuffle
wait 600
key SELECT          # Visualizer: its overlay owed, then on the BCM
wait 2500
shot bars
ab_mark f0
bcm_jobfail viz 2   # the next two visualiser frames fail
wait 2000
ab_mark f1
shot after_fail
bcm_jobfail viz 0   # off: disarmed, the op forgiven
wait 2000
ab_mark f2
shot bars_again
key SELECT          # back to Normal
wait 1200
